**Security-relevant decisions:**
- Camera permission rationale declared in native manifests (not requested at runtime without context).
- No image/data written to disk; frames processed in-memory only.
- Dependency `react-native-vision-camera` verified on npm registry; version pinned exactly.
- No analytics, logging, or clipboard access for scanned content.
- Component returns raw string; caller decides navigation/action (enforces §4 Deep Links: links never mutate state directly).

